msgstr "Förinställning: Minimal"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2034
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Maximum privacy. Disable all extended data sharing including progress and chapter info. Only your question and book metadata are sent."
msgstr "Maximal sekretess. Inaktivera all utökad datadelning inklusive framsteg och kapitelinformation. Endast din fråga och bokens metadata skickas."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2041
#, fuzzy
msgid "Preset: Full"
msgstr "Förval: Fullständig"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2042
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enable all data sharing for full functionality. Does not enable text extraction (see Text Extraction submenu)."
msgstr "Aktivera all datadelning för full funktionalitet. Aktiverar inte textextrahering (se undermenyn Textextrahering)."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2051
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tip: Per-book overrides"
